//
// Shared gRPC contract for node-to-node traffic across the ecosystem's AI
// and orchestration nodes (Vision AI Node, Cognitive AI Node, Orchestration
// & Swarm, Digital Twin & Simulation families).
//
// This does NOT replace:
//   - REST + WebSocket between STUDIO/HYDRA-UMC-ANDROID-CONTROL/
//     HYDRA-UMC-IOS-CONTROL and HYDRA-UMC-SERVER (human-facing client
//     traffic, out of scope here).
//   - CAN / CAN-OTA on the real HYDRA-UMC/URTC firmware (STM32 boards do
//     not, and will not, speak gRPC).
//   - The physical E-STOP signal path: HYDRA-UMC-SAFETY-ZONES may request
//     a stop over this channel, but the firmware is what actually asserts
//     it over CAN, independent of this protocol's own health.
//
// The protocol evolves through versioned public contract changes so that
// producers and consumers can validate compatibility independently.
//
// Status: v0. HealthService (below) is meant to be implemented by every
// node without exception - it is what lets HYDRA-UMC-NODE-HEALING probe
// any node in the ecosystem the same way. Per-family business services
// (vision detections, cognitive intents, job dispatch, physics stepping,
// ...) are intentionally NOT defined here yet - they get their own .proto
// file once each node's real logic lands, once there's an actual
// implementation to design the exact message shape against.
// =============================================================================

